#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (Veritas::DrillDownView, table)
#. +> trunk
#: reportwidget.ui:259
msgid ""
"Coverage report.\n"
"\n"
"In directory mode, the report summarizes the coverage with a list of all the directories that contain at least one covered file. It could include directories out of the specified path, depending on the files included in the source code.\n"
"\n"
"In file mode, all the files of the selected directory are shown. If several directories are selected, only the files of the last selected directory are shown. Double clicking on any of the items shows the associated file in the editor, annotated with the coverage information.\n"
"\n"
"You can change between directory and file mode using left and right keys."
msgstr ""
"Afdecken-Bericht:\n"
"\n"
"In den Orner-Bedrief wiest de Bericht en Tosamenfaten mit de List vun all Ornern, de tominnst een utföhrt Datei bargt. He mag Ornern buten den angeven Padd ümfaten, wenn Dateien Bornkode vun dor insluten doot.\n"
"\n"
"In den Datei-Bedrief warrt all Dateien ut den angeven Orner wiest. Is mehr as een Orner utsöcht, warrt bloots de Dateien ut den tolest utsöchten Ornern wiest. Mit en Dubbelklick op en Indrag wiest de tohören Datei binnen den Editor mit de Afdecken-Informatschonen as Anmarken.\n"
"\n"
"Du kannst mit de PielLinks- un PielRechts-Tasten twischen de Bedriefoorden wesseln."

